OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F132A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G1/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES C50th anniversary of an iconic
OL,4,CBBC One ident
OL,5,
OL,6,FARCHIVE: The TV Room
OL,7,
OL,8,FThis Saturday marks the 50th
OL,9,Fanniversary of the introduction of one
OL,10,Fof the BBC's most iconic images.
OL,11,
OL,12,FA modified version of BBC1's globe
OL,13,Fident was introduced on Saturday 28th
OL,14,FDecember 1974.
OL,15,
OL,16,FThe corporate 'BBC 1 COLOUR' ident was
OL,17,Freplaced by a large 'BBC 1' logo in the
OL,18,FFutura font.
OL,19,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,133,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13202
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F132A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G2/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES C50th anniversary of an iconic
OL,4,CBBC One ident
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe colour scheme changed dramatically
OL,7,Ftoo ` from pale blue and black to bold
OL,8,Forange, blue and white.
OL,9,
OL,10,FIt should be remembered though that
OL,11,Fmost viewers were still watching in
OL,12,Fblack and white in 1974, so for them,
OL,13,Fthe only obvious change would be to the
OL,14,Flogo.
OL,15,
OL,16,FThis was the second of three main
OL,17,Fversions of the mirror globe but for my
OL,18,Fmoney this is the definitive one.
OL,19,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,133,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13203
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F132A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G3/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES C50th anniversary of an iconic
OL,4,CBBC One ident
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision to drop the corporate logo
OL,7,Fseems surprising in retrospect but the
OL,8,Fcolour scheme is a huge improvement,
OL,9,Ftaking advantage of improved equipment.
OL,10,
OL,11,FIt should be noted that there were
OL,12,Ffurther changes in 1976. A new model
OL,13,Fwas created, as can clearly be seen
OL,14,Ffrom the geography of the globe.B The
OL,15,Fshape and positioning of Greenland is
OL,16,Fquite a giveaway.
OL,17,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,133,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13204
SC,0004
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F132A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G4/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES C50th anniversary of an iconic
OL,4,CBBC One ident
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is interesting to note too that BBC
OL,7,Fdocumentation from early 1974 ` now
OL,8,Favailable online ` reveals that thought
OL,9,Fwas given to changing the symbol
OL,10,Fradically.B However this idea was later
OL,11,Fabandoned.
OL,12,
OL,13,FIt's rather ironic though that this
OL,14,F"brand refresh" coincided with painful
OL,15,Fcuts to TV output.
OL,16,
OL,17,FIn 1974 inflation was running high in
OL,18,Fthe wake of the oil crisis a few months
OL,19,Fearlier.
OL,20,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,133,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13205
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F132A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G5/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES C50th anniversary of an iconic
OL,4,CBBC One ident
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC was campaigning for a
OL,7,Fsignificant rise in the TV Licence and
OL,8,Fconcerned about its deficit.
OL,9,
OL,10,FIn December 1974 major cuts to TV and
OL,11,Fradio output were announced, which were
OL,12,Fto take effect after the holiday
OL,13,Fseason.
OL,14,
OL,15,FOn BBC One, the fledgling afternoon
OL,16,Fservice ` filling the time available
OL,17,Fbetween afternoon schools programmes
OL,18,Fand children's programmes ` was
OL,19,Fabandoned.
OL,20,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,133,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13206
SC,0006
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F132A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G6/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES C50th anniversary of an iconic
OL,4,CBBC One ident
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe afternoon service was run on a
OL,7,Fshoestring and could not properly
OL,8,Fcompete with ITV's full afternoon
OL,9,Foffering, aimed principally at
OL,10,Fhousewives.
OL,11,
OL,12,FBut this was still the first time the
OL,13,FBBC had actively cut back or abandoned
OL,14,Fa service in peacetime in this way.
OL,15,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,133,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13207
SC,0007
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F132A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G7/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES C50th anniversary of an iconic
OL,4,CBBC One ident
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnother nasty cut happened at the same
OL,7,Ftime. Evening closedowns on weekdays on
OL,8,FBBC One were brought forward to
OL,9,F11.30pm, although thankfullyB this rule
OL,10,Fwas relaxed a few months later once
OL,11,Fsome increase in the licence fee was
OL,12,Fagreed.
OL,13,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,133,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13208
SC,0008
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F132A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G8/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES C50th anniversary of an iconic
OL,4,CBBC One ident
OL,5,
OL,6,F(BBC Two's hours were also cut in
OL,7,FJanuary 1975 andB daytime transmitter
OL,8,Fshutdowns were introduced as a further
OL,9,Feconomy measure. Various economies were
OL,10,Falso made to BBC Radio. However
OL,11,Fabandoning afternoon TV on the
OL,12,Fcorporation's flagship service was the
OL,13,Fmost immediately obvious effect of the
OL,14,Fcorporation's cash crisis, even though
OL,15,Fit was a new initiative and the test
OL,16,Fcard had never completely disappeared
OL,17,Ffrom the weekday afternoon schedule.)
OL,18,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,133,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13209
SC,0009
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F132A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G9/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES C50th anniversary of an iconic
OL,4,CBBC One ident
OL,5,
OL,6,FStill it is ironic that the
OL,7,Fintroduction of this iconic version of
OL,8,Fthe globe coincided with cuts to the
OL,9,Fservice.
OL,10,
OL,11,FIn those days, idents were meant to
OL,12,Flast. Careful consideration was given
OL,13,Fto changes as the expectation was that
OL,14,Fthe new look would last for several
OL,15,Fyears.
OL,16,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,133,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13210
SC,0010
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F132A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}         G10/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES C50th anniversary of an iconic
OL,4,CBBC One ident
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is worth noting that the corporate
OL,7,F"BBC 1" logo did not vanish with the
OL,8,Frevamp, which perhaps makes the
OL,9,Fdecision to remove it from the ident
OL,10,Fmore intriguing.
OL,11,
OL,12,FThe corporate logo stayed on programme
OL,13,Fslides and some trails for several
OL,14,Fmonths afterwards.
OL,15,
OL,16,FIndeed it only disappeared from generic
OL,17,Fnetwork programme menus around about
OL,18,Fthe same time as the next refresh of
OL,19,Fthe mirror globe in 1981.
OL,20,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,133,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13211
SC,0011
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F132A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}         G11/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES C50th anniversary of an iconic
OL,4,CBBC One ident
OL,5,
OL,6,FSo why is this particular version of
OL,7,Fthe globe just so special?
OL,8,
OL,9,FFor my money, the colour scheme is
OL,10,Fperfect and it emits an unashamed
OL,11,Fconfidence ` despite the serious
OL,12,Fproblems facing the BBC at the time.
OL,13,
OL,14,FIt should also be remembered that many
OL,15,Ffamilies got their first colour TV
OL,16,Fbetween 1974 and 1981.
OL,17,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,133,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13212
SC,0012
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F132A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}         G12/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES C50th anniversary of an iconic
OL,4,CBBC One ident
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe popularity of colour TVs only
OL,7,Fstarted to take off around 1973, helped
OL,8,Fby the wedding of Princess Anne. Before
OL,9,Fthen, they had been much more expensive
OL,10,Fin real terms.
OL,11,
OL,12,FThe number of colour licences first
OL,13,Fexceeded the number of black and white
OL,14,Flicences in 1976.
OL,15,
OL,16,FBy 1981, few had a black and white set
OL,17,Fin the living roomB unless they watched
OL,18,Flittle TV or would have struggled with
OL,19,Fthe cost.
OL,20,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,133,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13213
SC,0013
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F132A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}         G13/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES C50th anniversary of an iconic
OL,4,CBBC One ident
OL,5,
OL,6,FSo happy birthday to a fondly
OL,7,Fremembered ident which perfectly evokes
OL,8,Fits time.
OL,9,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,133,120,200,300,0,100@
